        {
          "id": 2156312028,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "So according to my new finding,\\\ndefault dissector shouldn't be static.\n\nInstead, it should be chosen dynamically depending on CLA (Class Byte) of the particular packet:\\\nhttps://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/20115#note_2156304240\n\nThe possibility to override this in the MBIM settings below could be kept, of course.",
