        {
          "id": 2156452665,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "Is there any case where the ISO 7816 should be preferred in the MBIM context? I do not think this should be the case but I added this possibility for you. Moreover such dynamic behavior should be added in the IDO 7816 dissector I think as it is not MBIM dissector responsabilité to parse the CLA byte (it does not even know what it is as the APDU is opaque to the MBIM layer).",
